    "job": "Check a form, a list of questions people answer, and give it as one record the person's AI can keep in a store, so it can be asked and its answers checked",
    "description": "Give a form_id, an optional title and presentation, and the questions. Each question needs a questionId and a questionTypeId (a row in the question-type list: text, long text, number, rating, choice, a reference to a file) and may carry a label, required, options, its own validation rules laid over its type's, and an afterSaved hand-off naming an owner and an action. Returns the form as one question-sequence record ({ id, type, value }) and how many questions it holds. Nothing is kept: write the record to a store to keep it; the same form_id gives the same record id.",
    "input_schema": {
     "type": "object",
     "additionalProperties": false,
     "required": [
      "form_id",
      "questions"
